<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>The awesome earth is tilted twenty-three—</l><l>For winter and summer—variety!</l><l>The awesome earth is tilted twenty-three—</l><l>Yes, it’s tilted twenty-three degrees.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>We’re circling the sun consistently;</l><l>Three hundred sixty-five days—reliably!</l><l>We’re circling the sun consistently;</l><l>Going sixty-seven thousand miles an hour.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>God made the earth’s orbit—just right!</l><l>It’s scientific—accurate—precise!</l><l>God made the earth’s orbit—just right!</l><l>Now isn’t it a beautiful sight?</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
